Indirect Material Inspection Workstation: third-party material in the film

Picture
- three.js r170 (MIT), rendered through the Lemo-Opuscar toolkit (MIT, github.com/lemomo-ai/lemo-opuscar), Exploded Teardown style
- HDRI "Photo Studio Loft Hall" from Poly Haven (CC0), used at low intensity for reflections
- Fonts: Inter (SIL Open Font License 1.1, fonts/OFL-inter.txt), JetBrains Mono (SIL OFL 1.1, fonts/OFL-jetbrainsmono.txt)

Voice
- Narration synthesised offline with Kokoro-82M (Apache 2.0) via kokoro-onnx (MIT), voice af_heart
- Speech check: faster-whisper (MIT) with Systran/faster-whisper-base.en

Music and sound
- Marimba, vibraphone, bowed vibraphone, glockenspiel, hi-hat: Versilian Community Sample Library (VCSL), CC0 1.0. Thanks to Versilian Studios / Sam Gossner.
- Bass, kick and all foley synthesised in code (mix.py)

Direction
- Voice-performance plan and stage review protocol from OpenMontage (github.com/calesthio/OpenMontage): skills/meta/voice-performance-director.md, skills/meta/reviewer.md

Content
- All dimensions from the user's specification sheet (see FACTS.md). The model is a 3D illustration built from that sheet, not a manufacturing drawing.
